# demo2: sep row14. shape above sep at rows 4-8, shifted down by 5 so bottom row at 13 = sep-1 (adjacent).
# So rule: move the shape along the separator's axis toward it, until its near edge is adjacent to the separator. Then repaint separator with 8.
